---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="404 - 页面航标未找到"
  description="很抱歉，您访问的星域坐标不存在或已迁移至新的网络路由。"
>
  <div class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto">
      <div class="text-7xl sm:text-8xl font-black font-mono tracking-tight text-gradient-brand">
        404
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">
        星域坐标未找到 · 页面不存在
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        您所请求的 URL 链接可能已失效、被移动或输入的地址有误。请检查网址或通过下方导航返回安全星域。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto text-sm">
          <span>返回官网首页</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto text-sm">
          <span>浏览套餐方案</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-purple-900/20 text-xs text-slate-400">
        常用链接：
        <a href="/guides/" class="hover:text-purple-300 ml-1">使用教程</a> ·
        <a href="/download/" class="hover:text-purple-300 ml-1">客户端下载</a> ·
        <a href="/faq/" class="hover:text-purple-300 ml-1">常见问题</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
